    <string name="view_privacy_policy">Buka Inqubomgomo Yobumfihlo (POPIA)</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Inqubomgomo Yobumfihlo ye-Kin+</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">Esikuqoqayo: igama lakho, i-imeyili, inombolo yocingo, indawo yakho ngenkathi ukwabelana kuvuliwe, kanye nemininingwane yoPhepho, yeNdawo Ephephile noma yoHambo ozikhethela ukuyisetha.\n\nKungani: ukwenza izici ozisebenzisayo zisebenze, njengokwabelana ngendawo yakho neZiyingi zakho, ukuthumela i-SOS enendawo yakho, izexwayiso zokungena nokuphuma eNdaweni Ephephile, nababheki boHambo Oluphephile.\n\nObona lokhu: amalungu eZiyingi ozijoyinayo kuphela angabona indawo yakho owabelana ngayo. Asisoze sathengisa imininingwane yakho kwabanye.\n\nUlwazi lwakho Lwezimo Eziphuthumayo (imininingwane yezempilo, imoto, amakheli, amakhodi okuphepha ekhaya) nanoma yisiphi isithombe osengezayo kugcinwa kule foni kuphela. Akuthunyelwa nanini kumaseva ethu.\n\nAmalungelo akho ngaphansi kwe-POPIA: ungabona, ulungise noma ususe imininingwane yakho noma nini. Ungamisa ukwabelana ngendawo ngokushesha kuZilungiselelo Zendawo, futhi ususe unomphela i-akhawunti yakho nedatha yayo kuPhrofayela.\n\nUkuphepha: yonke idatha ethunyelwa kumaseva ethu iyabethelwa. Amaphasiwedi avikelwa yi-Firebase Authentication, i-Kin+ ayiyigcini futhi ayiyiboni iphasiwedi yakho.</string>
